<speak>It's settling in, although not quite as neatly as the calendar suggests. On paper, I'm spending fewer days at the office. In practice, I still get calls about small things because people have been used to asking me for years. Sometimes it's simply where a document is kept or who normally speaks to a supplier. I've realised that stepping away isn't just a matter of leaving the building. I have to change the habits on both sides.</speak>